Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 02:17:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Resume a stored receipt jobId without a second POST.

Alerts freeze uses formatDate. Scan cancel passes AbortSignal into receipt compression. Meal-plan missing ingredients use shoppingCategory. Receipt recovery resumes a stored jobId without a second POST. Do not land until Phase A is on main.

Co-authored-by: Codygrant3 <Codygrant3@users.noreply.github.com>
